type: software
title: "DSP Palette: Distinctness-First Palette Extraction for Accessible Design Systems"
abstract: "Code and evaluation data for Distinctness-First Palette Selection (DSP), a constrained greedy algorithm that selects perceptually distinct, WCAG-accessible color palettes from images. Companion repository to the paper accepted to APSIPA ASC 2026, Track IVM."
